      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i checked the filters and they look fine. the ducts are in the attic so i cant really see if they're crushed or anything without a ladder and a flashlight. is there anything else that could be causing it that isn't obvious like a blocked vent? like maybe something more subtle in the walls or the insulation?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
