      "role": "user",
      "content": "a malfunctioning sunshield? i dont think there's anything like that in the room, just standard blinds. what do you mean by \"subtle\" things in the walls or insulation? like is there some kind of hidden part of the system that could be failing or just something that's just not working right behind the drywall?",
